{"id":"1f2f0d7b9495bf06","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy.md","title":"线性与平方规模的非一致电路严格分离","display":"thm-nonuniform-hierarchy — 线性与平方规模的非一致电路严格分离","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy","aliases":["28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-nonuniform-hierarchy — 线性与平方规模的非一致电路严格分离","depends_on":["[[28-df-size-class]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 6.22, proof specialization","source_printed_pages":"116","source_pdf_pages":"142","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nonuniform-hierarchy — 线性与平方规模的非一致电路严格分离"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3649d545bdff9369\" href=\"?note=3649d545bdff9369\" title=\"28-df-size-class\">28-df-size-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 6.22, proof specialization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"142"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SIZE}\">\\(\\operatorname{SIZE}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3649d545bdff9369\" href=\"?note=3649d545bdff9369\" title=\"28-df-size-class\">28-df-size-class</a> 的有界扇入、允许常数因子的规模类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SIZE}(n\\mapsto n+2)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{SIZE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SIZE}(n\\mapsto n+2)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{SIZE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取ℓ(n)=⌊(3/2)log₂(n+2)⌋。ℓ位输入、至多(n+2)log₂(n+2)个有界扇入门的电路，其描述数至多2^{O(n(log n)<sup>2)}，而全部ℓ位布尔函数有2</sup>{2<sup>ℓ}=2</sup>{Ω(n<sup>{3/2})}个。因此充分大n可选f_n超过该规模界。令g_n只把n位输入的前ℓ(n)位送入f_n；对每个固定常数c，大n时g_n不能有c(n+2)门。另一方面真值表析取范式用O(ℓ2</sup>ℓ)=O(n^{3/2}log n)门，故整个族在SIZE(n²)。有限小n任选常量函数。计数与上界均在本注内给出，得到书中证明特例的渐近版本。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 6.22, proof specialization；印刷 pp.116 / PDF pp.142。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-size-class","status":"resolved","id":"3649d545bdff9369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-size-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-size-class","status":"resolved","id":"3649d545bdff9369","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SIZE}$ 是 [[28-df-size-class]] 的有界扇入、允许常数因子的规模类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SIZE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SIZE}(n\\mapsto n+2)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{SIZE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^2).","display":true}],"bytes":1707,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-size-class]]、[[28-df-time-advice-class]]、[[28-thm-p-poly-advice]]、[[28-thm-p-uniform-characterization]]、[[28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy]]、[[28-df-circuit-eval]]。"}],"outgoing":["3649d545bdff9369"]}